<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Everything a group knows usually dies inside the room it was said in. A channel can choose otherwise: its founder can open a public archive, and from that moment the channel gets a page per day that anybody can read and a search engine can index."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lock}>{dgettext("help_features", "Who can")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "The founder, and nobody else. An operator moderates the room; deciding that what is said in it becomes readable from outside is a different kind of decision, so it belongs to whoever answers for the channel. The switch is in Channel Central, on the Registration tab, or typed as /cs archive on and /cs archive off; only a registered channel has one."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tab_control}>{dgettext("help_features", "What is published")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Only what is said from the moment the switch goes on. Nothing already in the channel is ever published, however long it has been there — whoever wrote it wrote it into a room, not onto the internet. Everyone present is told when the switch changes, so nobody learns it from a search engine."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_rules}>{dgettext("help_features", "Rules & Limits")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext("help_features", "Deleted messages are absent; edited ones are marked as edited")}
  </li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_features", "Joins, parts and other channel notices are not published")}</li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "Attachments are never published — the page only notes that one was there"
    )}
  </li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_features", "A secret channel cannot have a public archive")}</li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_features", "Switching it off takes every page down straight away")}</li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "A busy day is split into pages of 200 lines, with Earlier and Later links between them"
    )}
  </li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_features", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="feature-channel-central">
    {dgettext("help_features", "Channel Central")}
  </.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="chanserv-register">
    {dgettext("help_features", "Registering a channel")}
  </.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="cmd-cs">{dgettext("help_features", "/cs")}</.help_link>
</p>
